title: "active_subspaces: Python Active-subspaces Utility Library"
abstract: >-
  Python tools for discovering and exploiting active subspaces: low-dimensional
  structure in functions of many inputs, with subspace estimation, geometry of the
  active variables, surrogates, integration, optimization and reduced models.
type: software
version: 1.0.0.dev0
